  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the radioactive mudflats outside Subchain City, Virgil was always a survivor. He honed his skills scavenging in Smashy's Shop, turning broken glass and scavenged metal into deadly weapons and fashionable, yet functional, attire. Now, he's ready to carve his way to the top of the DRIP heap… one shard of glass at a time.",
    "class": "Wastelander Scavenger",
    "name": "Virgil 'Shard' Scabsworth",
    "personality": "Cynical and opportunistic, Virgil sees the humor in the grim reality of Subchain City. He's pragmatic, valuing survival above all else, but carries a twisted sense of loyalty to those in his ragtag flock. He also has a deep seated love for drip, and will do anything to acquire larger amounts of it for himself and his allies.",
